[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817256148","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105576#issuecomment-2817256148","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105576","id":2817256148,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n6-rU","user":{"login":"GustJc","id":3084189,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODQxODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3084189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc","html_url":"https://github.com/GustJc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-20T17:02:02Z","updated_at":"2025-04-20T17:02:02Z","body":"So, I've take a better look on the problem. For some reason on windows, when using the \"wintab\" driver, the update mouse velocity is a bit delayed. So when the tooltip is created, it triggers, \r\nBecause the mouse speed just before you put the mouse inside the tooltip is still there.\r\n```cpp\r\nif (!_is_mouse_inside_tooltip && OS::get_singleton()->get_ticks_msec() - _enter_tree_time > 250) {\r\n    _start_timer();\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nIncreasing this time a little bit seems to solve the issue.\r\n\r\nMy guess is that the tooltip delay to start the tooltip in inspectors is about 200~250 ms, and a few ms delay that wintab creates is just enough for it to trigger this.\r\n\r\nAlso a note: the docs and other tooltips are handled very differently, they don't have this 'fix' and work in any case no matter the delay. The tooltip delay ProjectSettings only affect them. And InspectorEditor tooltips are always about a 250ms delay to popup.\r\n\r\nBut this I feel is another issue that should be handled separately.\r\nFor now, adjusting this delay fixes the driver tooltip disappearing issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817256148/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884250694","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105576#issuecomment-2884250694","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105576","id":2884250694,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6r6ixG","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T15:30:18Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T15:30:18Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2884250694/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]